UP-Progress.mcc/UPA_Progress_Value
UP-Progress.mcc/UPA_Progress_Max

/****** UP-Progress.mcc/UPA_Progress_Value ******
*
*   NAME
*       UPA_Progress_Value -- attribute of UP-Progress.mcc
*
*   FUNCTION
*       LONG: filled part
*
*   INPUTS
*       UPA_Progress_Value - access ISG. Tag value from <mcc/up.h>.
*
*   RESULT
*       Read with GetAttr/get(), set with SetAttrs/set() or in the MUI_NewObject tag list, as the access letters allow (I = initial, S = set, G = get).
*
*   SEE ALSO
*       <mcc/up.h>, UP-Progress.mcc
*
******/

/****** UP-Progress.mcc/UPA_Progress_Max ******
*
*   NAME
*       UPA_Progress_Max -- attribute of UP-Progress.mcc
*
*   FUNCTION
*       LONG: value that fills the bar
*
*   INPUTS
*       UPA_Progress_Max - access ISG. Tag value from <mcc/up.h>.
*
*   RESULT
*       Read with GetAttr/get(), set with SetAttrs/set() or in the MUI_NewObject tag list, as the access letters allow (I = initial, S = set, G = get).
*
*   SEE ALSO
*       <mcc/up.h>, UP-Progress.mcc
*
******/
